<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">ETH Zurich</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">founded <a href="/years/1855">1855</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Also known as Swiss Federal Institute of Technology in Zurich, Eidgenössische Technische Hochschule Zürich, Federal Polytechnic School</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">ETH Zurich is a public university of science and technology in Zürich, founded by the Swiss federal state as the Federal Polytechnic School and opened in 1855. It became one of the leading <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/technical-university">technical universities</a> in the world; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/albert-einstein">Albert Einstein</a> studied and later taught there, and more than twenty Nobel laureates have been associated with it.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/eth-zurich.jpg" alt="ETH Zurich" width="320" height="480" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Roland zh · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ETH_Z%C3%BCrich_-_Hauptgeb%C3%A4ude_-_Unispital_2012-07-30_07-57-03_ShiftN.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Zürich founded a university in 1833, became the seat of the <b>Federal Polytechnic</b> in 1855 and grew into Switzerland’s largest city and financial centre, and the canton remains the most populous in Switzerland.</blockquote><a href="/empire/canton-of-zurich">Canton of Zürich · Decline &amp; Fall</a></li><li><blockquote>The <b>Federal Polytechnic School</b> in Zurich, founded in 1855 and now ETH Zurich, became one of the leading technical universities, and in 1905 Albert Einstein, then a clerk at the patent office in Bern, published his papers on relativity.</blockquote><a href="/empire/swiss-confederation">Swiss Confederation · Global &amp; Regional Impact</a></li></ul></section>
